              <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>
                  It depends on the product and the week. Walmart's shelf prices and Rollbacks are often competitive on budget brands like Six Star and Body Fortress, while Amazon's Subscribe and Save can beat them on the same tubs. Work out cost per 25 g of protein at both on the day you buy, using the same tub size.
                </p>
