                  For the price, yes. Per the label, one 45 g scoop gives 30 g of protein for about 180 calories, and the 3.9 lb tub is in the budget tier per gram. It uses maltodextrin and two artificial sweeteners, and its NSF Contents Certified claim is not the same as NSF Certified for Sport, so tested athletes should look elsewhere.
                </p>
              </div>
            </details>

